{"about_the_game":"Simulation.<br>Sandbox.<br>Survival.<br><br>DeadOS is an early access zombie outbreak simulator that focuses on city-wide outbreak scenarios where you have full access to customization of the experience from beginning to end, made by indie game developer and randomizer creator Benn Powell.<br><br>Build your own zombie apocalypse! Do you want slow, shambling hordes that consume the living, or a fast, rapidly spreading infection that doesn't allow time to react?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up to 25,000 humans simulated in a city area of up to 900 city blocks.<br></li><li>Nearly every element of the simulation is adjustable. Zombie speed. Human Accuracy. Ammunition. <br></li><li>Take remote control of any individual during any point of the simulation, whether they are survivor or infected.<br></li><li>Create your own city blocks to personalize the city<br></li><li>Adjustable simulation speed to optimal performance for your machine.<br></li><li>Retro visual style</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Establishing Battlefield Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590850/8c91cd10b9d83ecc425f0fcd531ff19082e02f1b.jpg"},{"name":"Now I Have a Machine Gun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590850/be807417ffe4d92bad12341673438bcce49a75b6.jpg"},{"name":"And Now We Have a Rather Unfortunate Turn of Events","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590850/288a88d73faef78fe42c8cd2dd453eb6f50e6545.jpg"},{"name":"Reinforcements Have Arrived","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590850/3fa893739e14a735255dba0451901b0d034919a4.jpg"},{"name":"City Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590850/88cdf0e3d649ce2cde36f2fa3dc813e67b82a16a.jpg"},{"name":"I Am In Charge Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat